OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Fsome showers, becoming lighter and
OL,7,Fmore isolated through the day. Strong
OL,8,Fwesterly winds at first will steadily
OL,9,Fease through the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMainly dry evening with
OL,12,Fbright then clear spells and only the
OL,13,Fodd light shower. Outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fwill spread north to Orkney overnight,
OL,15,Fjust reaching Shetland by morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FOccasionally heavy rain
OL,18,Fspreads north through the day, turning
OL,19,Fmore showery later. Strong southerly
OL,20,Fwinds developing, chance of coastal
OL,21,Fgales later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
