OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells at first Monday, then becoming
OL,7,Fwindy with gales and occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy rain or showers, this persisting
OL,9,Fthrough Tuesday, then becoming drier
OL,10,Fand brighter through Wednesday as
OL,11,Fwinds ease.
